|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of a triangular matrix is equal to the product of the entries on the main diagonal. Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =3|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-2)\\cdot 4\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-120\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume is\n\n$$\nV=|det(M)|=|-120|=120.\n$$" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318758 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318759 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318760 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318761 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318762 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1041 "selection" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318761 13194139534906 true] [17592186318757 1110 #uuid "d906e97b-c674-59f8-b0d3-d8197aa9991b" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318758 1034 "180" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318758 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534906 true] [17592186318758 1111 #uuid "3dc1cc13-f03e-58dc-bef6-87969413fb7f" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318759 1034 "60" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318759 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534906 true] [17592186318759 1111 #uuid "977f19bc-2912-5bd3-936d-670f4014845c" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318760 1034 "40" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318760 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534906 true] [17592186318760 1111 #uuid "c3fc1cd5-263d-531c-a38a-bb95052bffe5" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318761 1034 "120" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318761 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534906 true] [17592186318761 1111 #uuid "c54c497c-4d3e-5628-acba-05a2a823f834" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318762 1034 "480" 13194139534906 true] [17592186318762 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534906 true] [17592186318762 1111 #uuid "e01895aa-814e-5d0f-8478-ea94df61049f" 13194139534